content:
@everyone An illusory image pops into existence in the middle of the town square. A very handsome man dressed in robes addresses any who are nearby.

"How did everyone like my little Octopodidae welcoming party? I told it to give you...a hand getting to shore. Well, to be honest, I can't really take credit for that. From what I heard, you basically sank your little boat all by yourselves. Anyway, let me formally welcome you to this all-expenses-paid resort (food and safety not included, death and dismemberment may apply). I am sooooo looking forward to murdering you-- I mean meeting you all. Well, good luck out there my little blushing adventurers!"

The image ends in a puff of sparkles.
